{"id":"3b8b3b1a1bbba5e8","group":"58","path":"58/batch09/58-df-lebesgue-measurable.md","title":"Lebesgue Measurable Set","display":"df-lebesgue-measurable — Lebesgue Measurable Set","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-lebesgue-measurable","aliases":["58-df-lebesgue-measurable"],"display":"df-lebesgue-measurable — Lebesgue Measurable Set","depends_on":["[[../batch16/58-df-borel.md]]","[[../batch10/58-df-lebesgue.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-lebesgue-measurable"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-lebesgue-measurable</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-lebesgue-measurable — Lebesgue Measurable Set"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"9375de7089953a2b\" href=\"?note=9375de7089953a2b\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-borel.md\">../batch16/58-df-borel.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"68427bc628af9b8d\" href=\"?note=68427bc628af9b8d\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-lebesgue.md\">../batch10/58-df-lebesgue.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\mathbb R\">\\(A\\subseteq\\mathbb R\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_{\\mathbb R}\\coloneqq\\{U\\subseteq\\mathbb R:\\forall x\\in U\\;\\exists\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;((x-\\varepsilon,x+\\varepsilon)\\subseteq U)\\}\">\\(\\tau_{\\mathbb R}\\coloneqq\\{U\\subseteq\\mathbb R:\\forall x\\in U\\;\\exists\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;((x-\\varepsilon,x+\\varepsilon)\\subseteq U)\\}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda^*:\\mathcal P(\\mathbb R)\\to[0,\\infty]\">\\(\\lambda^*:\\mathcal P(\\mathbb R)\\to[0,\\infty]\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LebesgueMeasurable}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{LebesgueMeasurable}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"68427bc628af9b8d\" href=\"?note=68427bc628af9b8d\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-lebesgue.md\">../batch10/58-df-lebesgue.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Borel}(B,\\mathbb R,\\tau_{\\mathbb R})\">\\(\\mathrm{Borel}(B,\\mathbb R,\\tau_{\\mathbb R})\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"9375de7089953a2b\" href=\"?note=9375de7089953a2b\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-borel.md\">../batch16/58-df-borel.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LebesgueBorelCompletion}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{LebesgueBorelCompletion}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}lebesgue\\text{-}borel\\text{-}completion}\\vdash\\mathrm{LebesgueBorelCompletion}_S(A)\\leftrightarrow A\\subseteq\\mathbb R\\land\\exists B,N\\subseteq\\mathbb R\\;(\\mathrm{Borel}(B,\\mathbb R,\\tau_{\\mathbb R})\\land\\mathrm{Borel}(N,\\mathbb R,\\tau_{\\mathbb R})\\land\\lambda^*(N)=0\\land A\\mathbin\\triangle B\\subseteq N)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}lebesgue\\text{-}borel\\text{-}completion}\\vdash\\mathrm{LebesgueBorelCompletion}_S(A)\\leftrightarrow A\\subseteq\\mathbb R\\land\\exists B,N\\subseteq\\mathbb R\\;(\\mathrm{Borel}(B,\\mathbb R,\\tau_{\\mathbb R})\\land\\mathrm{Borel}(N,\\mathbb R,\\tau_{\\mathbb R})\\land\\lambda^*(N)=0\\land A\\mathbin\\triangle B\\subseteq N)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}lebesgue\\text{-}measurable\\text{-}completion}\\vdash\\mathrm{LebesgueMeasurable}_S(A)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{LebesgueBorelCompletion}_S(A)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}lebesgue\\text{-}measurable\\text{-}completion}\\vdash\\mathrm{LebesgueMeasurable}_S(A)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{LebesgueBorelCompletion}_S(A)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>每个 Lebesgue 可测集都可写成一个 Borel 集与某个 Borel 零测集之子集的对称差。</li>\n<li>零测集的任意子集仍然 Lebesgue 可测，但不必是 Borel 集。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{L}\">\\(\\mathcal{L}\\)</span> 包含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{B}(\\mathbb{R})\">\\(\\mathcal{B}(\\mathbb{R})\\)</span> 并对 Lebesgue 测度完备</li>\n<li>Vitali 集不是 Lebesgue 可测的（依赖 AC）</li>\n<li>完备性：若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E \\in \\mathcal{L}\">\\(E \\in \\mathcal{L}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|E| = 0\">\\(|E| = 0\\)</span>，则任意 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A \\subseteq E\">\\(A \\subseteq E\\)</span> 也是 Lebesgue 可测的</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch16/58-df-borel.md","status":"resolved","id":"9375de7089953a2b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-borel.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch10/58-df-lebesgue.md","status":"resolved","id":"68427bc628af9b8d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-df-lebesgue.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch10/58-df-lebesgue.md","status":"resolved","id":"68427bc628af9b8d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\lambda^*:\\mathcal P(\\mathbb R)\\to[0,\\infty]$, $\\mathrm{LebesgueMeasurable}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch10/58-df-lebesgue.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-borel.md","status":"resolved","id":"9375de7089953a2b","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Borel}(B,\\mathbb R,\\tau_{\\mathbb R})$ (see [[../batch16/58-df-borel.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A\\subseteq\\mathbb R","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau_{\\mathbb R}\\coloneqq\\{U\\subseteq\\mathbb R:\\forall x\\in U\\;\\exists\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\;((x-\\varepsilon,x+\\varepsilon)\\subseteq U)\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\lambda^*:\\mathcal P(\\mathbb R)\\to[0,\\infty]","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LebesgueMeasurable}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Borel}(B,\\mathbb R,\\tau_{\\mathbb R})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LebesgueBorelCompletion}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}lebesgue\\text{-}borel\\text{-}completion}\\vdash\\mathrm{LebesgueBorelCompletion}_S(A)\\leftrightarrow A\\subseteq\\mathbb R\\land\\exists B,N\\subseteq\\mathbb R\\;(\\mathrm{Borel}(B,\\mathbb R,\\tau_{\\mathbb R})\\land\\mathrm{Borel}(N,\\mathbb R,\\tau_{\\mathbb R})\\land\\lambda^*(N)=0\\land A\\mathbin\\triangle B\\subseteq N)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}lebesgue\\text{-}measurable\\text{-}completion}\\vdash\\mathrm{LebesgueMeasurable}_S(A)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{LebesgueBorelCompletion}_S(A)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal{L}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal{B}(\\mathbb{R})","display":false},{"tex":"E \\in \\mathcal{L}","display":false},{"tex":"|E| = 0","display":false},{"tex":"A \\subseteq E","display":false}],"bytes":1772,"backlinks":[{"id":"e9ef09a86db92f05","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{LebesgueMeasurable}_S$ (Lebesgue-measurable-set predicate, see [[58-df-lebesgue-measurable]])"},{"id":"57ef15d90618ea60","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"bc6b982512ea7cbd","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{LebesgueMeasurable}_S,\\mathrm{Countable}_S\\subseteq V$, $\\mathrm{Perfect}_S\\subseteq V^3$, and $\\mathrm{MetricSpace}_S\\subseteq V^2$ (see [[../batch09/58-df-lebesgue-measurable.md]], [[./58-df-countable.md]], [[../batch08/58-df-perfect.md]], [[../batch16/58-df-metric-space.md]])."},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-766","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-lebesgue-measurable.md|58-df-lebesgue-measurable]]（batch09）"}],"outgoing":["9375de7089953a2b","68427bc628af9b8d"]}